      "username": "kitmehsu",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/{size}/1901_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-18T01:58:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I think i've gotten most of the work done on the roll20 board, and since the playtest wasn't recorded due to issues, I wanted to do a pick up game via twitch stream tomorrow night so I can get game footage and just show off the work I did.</p><p>Where:&nbsp;http://www.twitch.tv/kitmehsu</p><p>When: 6pm EDT Mar 18</p><p>What: A streamed game of Sentinel Tactics through the online service roll20, where the players will be sent invites from those watching the stream. &nbsp;The set-up will be the same as PAX-South, with a potental second game pending interest/time</p><p>Who: Anyone can join the stream, though it will help to have registered with roll20 if you want to try and join the game.</p><p>Technically this is seperate from the invite tests, so even if you're part of it, this will actually be part of different campaign so the links will be to a different version. &nbsp;Also, for a teaser of whats to come, I've attached a screenshot of just what i've done in the game.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:16.998Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
