      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>So I think i&#39;ve gotten most of the work done on the roll20 board, and since the playtest wasn&#39;t recorded due to issues, I wanted to do a pick up game via twitch stream tomorrow night so I can get game footage and just show off the work I did.</p><p>Where:&nbsp;http://www.twitch.tv/kitmehsu</p><p>When: 6pm EDT Mar 18</p><p>What: A streamed game of Sentinel Tactics through the online service roll20, where the players will be sent invites from those watching the stream. &nbsp;The set-up will be the same as PAX-South, with a potental second game pending interest/time</p><p>Who: Anyone can join the stream, though it will help to have registered with roll20 if you want to try and join the game.</p><p>Technically this is seperate from the invite tests, so even if you&#39;re part of it, this will actually be part of different campaign so the links will be to a different version. &nbsp;Also, for a teaser of whats to come, I&#39;ve attached a screenshot of just what i&#39;ve done in the game.</p>",
